    "chapter17_target": "17. Doc・MathのHTML\n生成\nせいせい\nと\n数式表示\nすうしきひょうじ",
    "reload_target": "http://127.0.0.1:56889/NEPL3/docs/spec/17-math-html.html"
  },
  {
    "headings": [
      "06. Math言語",
      "方針",
      "1. 表現",
      "2. 構造検査",
      "3. evaluate",
      "4. MathML backend",
      "4.1. 公開arenaと原文保持",
      "5. 出力と資源",
